      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GENERAL FRANKY (1) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 1.75 lengths second (29.50) over 515m at Sandown. Comes through a solid form race last start. One of the leading chances. DRAMATICAL (4) boasts a strong record this course with three wins and two minors from seven tries. Below best last time at Sandown (30.18) in a Mix 3/4, finishing a 14 length fifth. Among the main chances. ELITE ONE (2) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish one length back in second (34.81) at Sandown in a Grade 4/5 over 595m. Expected to be in this for a long way. HOT NANU (5) has to be respected despite coming off a five-and-a-half weeks break.",
